  "description": "Ye-Won Han, a career woman who is honest and takes the lead in company work more than anyone else. In fact, she has a secret that she cannot tell anyone, and it is that she reveals it more than anyone else! Ye-Won, who has fun when she plays and maintains and manages her reputation as a perfect career woman at work, is faced with a crisis. Choi Eun-Ho, who she slept with last night, has joined a different team. Will Ye-Won be able to protect her reputation?\n\n(Source: BookCube, translated)",
